-  # 4. Report and close. Runs on `always()` so a failed trigger still closes
+  # 4. Record the deployment the train just attempted, pinned to the green
+  # sha that was scoped and triggered. required_contexts is empty so the
+  # deployment is created immediately instead of waiting on commit statuses
+  # green intentionally does not have. The status follows the trigger
